---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import AppointmentShowcase from "../components/AppointmentShowcase.astro";
---
<SiteLayout title="Appointment Setting Services" description="Lead generation creates opportunities; a real person following up by phone helps turn them into booked sales appointments. Our optional appointment-setting s" path="/appointment-setting/">
<section class="lf-page-hero"><div class="container lf-hero-inner"><div class="lf-hero-copy"><p class="section-kicker">05 / APPOINTMENT SETTING</p><h1>Turn relevant inquiries into real conversations.</h1><p class="lf-lede">Lead generation creates opportunities; a real person following up by phone helps turn them into booked sales appointments. Our appointment setters call incoming leads, qualify their needs, answer questions and book appointments directly with your sales team.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/">Discuss your goals <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><aside class="lf-hero-aside"><span>WHY IT MATTERS</span><strong>Real phone conversations that qualify leads and book appointments for your team.</strong><span class="lf-aside-mark" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></aside></div></section>
<AppointmentShowcase />
<section class="lf-page-section lf-section-muted"><div class="container"><div class="lf-section-head"><p class="section-kicker">THE CAPABILITIES</p><h2>What we can help you build.</h2></div><div class="lf-detail-grid"><article class="lf-detail-card"><span class="lf-card-index">01</span><h3>Qualification criteria</h3><p>Agree on what makes a lead relevant, including fit, intent, service area and practical requirements.</p></article>
<article class="lf-detail-card"><span class="lf-card-index">02</span><h3>Outbound lead calls</h3><p>Call incoming inquiries, ask qualification questions, handle common objections and retry unanswered calls using an agreed follow-up process.</p></article>
<article class="lf-detail-card"><span class="lf-card-index">03</span><h3>Appointment booking</h3><p>Our setter offers available times, books qualified prospects into your calendar and records the outcome for the sales team.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="lf-page-section"><div class="container lf-split"><div class="lf-sticky-head"><p class="section-kicker">HOW WE WORK</p><h2>Clear steps.<br />Connected execution.</h2><p>Measure booked conversations, not just form submissions.</p></div><ol class="lf-process"><li><span>01</span><div><h3>Qualify</h3><p>Agree on the attributes that make an inquiry worth pursuing.</p></div></li>
<li><span>02</span><div><h3>Call</h3><p>Call each eligible inbound lead promptly and introduce the service.</p></div></li>
<li><span>03</span><div><h3>Qualify</h3><p>Ask about the prospect’s needs, fit, timing and readiness; follow up on unanswered calls.</p></div></li>
<li><span>04</span><div><h3>Book and hand off</h3><p>Confirm the appointment in the client’s calendar and hand over the call notes and qualification details.</p></div></li></ol></div></section>
<section class="lf-page-section lf-section-muted"><div class="container lf-split"><div class="lf-sticky-head"><p class="section-kicker">COMMON QUESTIONS</p><h2>Questions worth asking.</h2></div><div class="lf-faq-list"><details><summary>Is appointment setting included with paid ads?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>No. Appointment setting is an optional add-on. Its scope depends on the volume and quality of inquiries and the follow-up work required.</p></details>
<details><summary>Do you contact cold prospects?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Our appointment setters focus on calling incoming inquiries and following up with leads provided through agreed channels. Any broader outbound work would require a separate scope and compliance review.</p></details>
<details><summary>What counts as a booked appointment?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>We define booking status, qualification requirements and reporting terms before work begins.</p></details></div></div></section>
<section class="lf-page-section"><div class="container"><div class="lf-section-head"><p class="section-kicker">CONNECTED SERVICES</p><h2>Better together.</h2></div><div class="lf-related"><a class="lf-related-link" href="/crm-automation/"><span>CRM &amp; Marketing Automation Services</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
<a class="lf-related-link" href="/performance-marketing/"><span>Performance Marketing Agency</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="lf-page-section lf-section-muted lf-setting-models" aria-labelledby="lf-setting-models-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="lf-section-head">
      <p class="section-kicker">HUMAN + AI APPOINTMENT SETTING</p>
      <h2 id="lf-setting-models-title">The right voice for every lead.</h2>
      <p>Appointment setting means actively contacting interested prospects, qualifying them, answering initial questions and booking the right next conversation. We can design that process around people, AI voice agents or a combination of both.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lf-setting-model-grid">
      <article class="lf-setting-model-card"><span class="lf-setting-model-no">01 / HUMAN CALLERS</span><h3>Personal conversations.</h3><p>Trained appointment setters call leads, learn what they need, handle initial questions and schedule qualified appointments with your team.</p><span class="lf-setting-model-tag">Human-led outreach</span></article>
      <article class="lf-setting-model-card"><span class="lf-setting-model-no">02 / AI VOICE AGENTS</span><h3>Responsive calling at scale.</h3><p>Configured AI voice agents can call eligible leads, ask approved qualifying questions, capture answers and offer available appointment times, with clear disclosure and escalation rules.</p><span class="lf-setting-model-tag">AI-assisted conversations</span></article>
      <article class="lf-setting-model-card"><span class="lf-setting-model-no">03 / HYBRID TEAM</span><h3>Automation with a human handoff.</h3><p>AI handles defined first-contact or follow-up tasks while your team takes over nuanced questions, objections and situations that need a person.</p><span class="lf-setting-model-tag">Flexible handoffs</span></article>
    </div>
    <p class="lf-setting-model-note">Calling workflows are scoped to your business, lead permissions, applicable calling and recording rules, and required human oversight. Availability and results depend on the implementation.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="lf-end-cta"><div class="container lf-cta-inner"><div><p class="section-kicker">LET'S TALK GROWTH</p><h2>Build a more reliable path to your next customer.</h2></div><a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
